  "boundary": "Executed in vm: the pOs progress literal with lU/Ms from _675.js, the TaskOutput call body with a synthetic registry, BUr with the pinned _Wt/NIt sets and stubbed opaque error classes (zL/hk/HL/MH/ye/IH never match plain Errors; zx/AT stubbed false: the owned tools throw no fs errors), the _823.js Q literal and the DMt hint tail with vb. Recorded statically: the resume lane order, the gOs catch routing, the runToolUse ids. Not established: Aw(name, mcpNameLoggable) for MCP tools (stubbed empty per the owned non-MCP family), Tz (abort signal check) body, the session_end/conversation_clear scopes as gateway moments, live acceptance."
